{"id":444,"name":"gabite","speciesId":444,"dex":444,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["dragon","ground"],"stats":{"hp":68,"attack":90,"defense":65,"special-attack":50,"special-defense":55,"speed":82},"abilities":[{"name":"sand-veil","hidden":false},{"name":"rough-skin","hidden":true}],"height":14,"weight":560,"baseExp":144,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/444.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/444.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/444.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/444.ogg","genus":"Cave Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon da Caverna","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"There is a long-held belief that medicine made from its scales will heal even incurable illnesses."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It habitually digs up and hoards gems in its nest. Its loot is constantly targeted by thieves."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It loves sparkly things. It seeks treasures in caves and hoards the loot in its nest."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"As it digs to expand its nest, it habitually digs up gems that it then hoards in its nest."},{"version":"sun","text":"In rare cases, it molts and sheds its scales. Medicine containing its scales as an ingredient will make a weary body feel invigorated."},{"version":"moon","text":"Shiny objects are its passion. It can be found in its cave, scarcely moving, its gaze fixed on the jewels it’s amassed or Carbink it has caught."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It loves shiny things. When it finds a Sableye trying to catch a Carbink, Gabite becomes furiously angry and attacks the Sableye."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sheds its skin and gradually grows larger. Its scales can be ground into a powder and used as raw materials for traditional medicine."},{"version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon emits ultrasonic waves from a protrusion on either side of its head to probe pitch-dark caves."},{"version":"shield","text":"Jewels are buried in the caves these Pokémon nest in, but you’ll be torn apart by claws and fangs the moment you enter one of these caves."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"Though Gabite are usually of a violent disposition, when I gave one a glass bead it had been eyeing covetously, it suddenly became quite docile."}],"flavorPt":"Embora Gabite geralmente tenha uma disposição violenta, quando dei a alguém uma conta de vidro que ele estava olhando cobiçosamente, de repente ele se tornou bastante dócil.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["monster","dragon"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"gible","speciesId":443,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 24"],"species":"gabite","speciesId":444,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 48"],"species":"garchomp","speciesId":445,"evolvesTo":[]}]}]},"varieties":[{"id":444,"name":"gabite","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/444.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":14,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0]]},{"id":28,"learn":[[8,"lv",1],[8,"lv",3],[9,"lv",1],[9,"lv",3],[10,"lv",1],[10,"lv",3],[11,"lv",1],[11,"lv",3],[14,"lv",1],[14,"lv",3],[15,"lv",1],[15,"lv",3],[16,"lv",1],[16,"lv",3],[17,"lv",1],[17,"lv",3],[18,"lv",1],[18,"lv",3],[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[8,"lv",1],[9,"lv",1],[10,"lv",1],[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[24,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":34,"learn":[[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[8,"lv",15],[9,"lv",15],[10,"lv",15],[11,"lv",15],[14,"lv",15],[15,"lv",15],[16,"lv",15],[17,"lv",15